  ('exam', 2015, 'Língua Inglesa', NULL, 'Q44 Item 1 (TPS 2015): In reference to the linguistic features of the text, decide whether the following statements are right (C) or wrong (E). | In the sentence “Since then (...) should follow” (R. 4 to 7), the reference to Memory’s sister is based on the fragment “this remarkable young woman” and the two occurrences of “her”.', '{"a":"Certo","b":"Errado"}'::jsonb, 'b', NULL),
  ('exam', 2015, 'Língua Inglesa', NULL, 'Q44 Item 2 (TPS 2015): In reference to the linguistic features of the text, decide whether the following statements are right (C) or wrong (E). | By using the expression “blazing a trail” (R.6), the authors inform the reader that Memory has opened a glowing and intense path as a result of her work.', '{"a":"Certo","b":"Errado"}'::jsonb, 'a', NULL),
